  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSolidly engineered and comprehensively refurbished, this timeless elevated coastal residence has been reimagined for effortless, low maintenance luxury living with a panoramic outlook and generous dimensions. A meticulously curated 251sqm executive lock and leave, it’s equally enticing as an exceptional family haven.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1980s to stand the test of time – the ground floor is concrete and the mid- floor brick. Everything except the structure is beautifully brand new, from double glazing to pale timber flooring. Elegant light-filled interiors and sophisticated finishes evoke the flavour of a 6-star coastal retreat, while mature drought-resistant planting\r\nand contemporary, low maintenance landscaping enhance privacy across the 731sqm property.\r\n\r\nOn the upper level, a stylish new kitchen with warm coastal hues and sweeping granite island sets the scene for relaxed indoor outdoor entertaining. On one side, bifolds open to a covered balcony while on the other, expansive living extends to a spectacular landscaped terrace with built-in barbecue - ready for the good times.\r\nThere are no lawns to distract you from a sun-soaked viewing platform, where a harbour vista rewards up some steps.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully divided between 2 levels, 4 bedrooms offer flexibility, complemented by 3 new bathrooms in soft sandy tones. The large welcoming entry leads to 2 bedrooms that share an ensuite. Upstairs, the master suite has a dreamy ensuite and a family bathroom includes a bath.\r\n\r\nAround the corner from Kohi beach, boating enthusiasts can practically wheel their boat home from the water. Walk to eateries and there’s double carpeted garaging with a separate laundry plus huge storage and at least 5 off-street carparks. Your luxuriously easy, very practical coastal lifestyle beckons.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
